                    <span>{ex.id}. {ex.title}</span>
                    <span class="card-done-tag hidden text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-950/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-500/50">✓ Misión Cumplida (+100 XP)</span>
